  "data": {
    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Brood Brothers Auxilia",
    "summary": "Your army may include **ASTRA MILITARUM** units even though they lack the Faction keyword **GENESTEALER CULTS**, up to a combined cost of:\n\n- 500 points at Incursion\n- 1,000 points at Strike Force\n- 1,500 points at Onslaught\n\nYour **WARLORD** has to be a **GENESTEALER CULTS** model, and your **ASTRA MILITARUM** models lose [Voice of Command](vsdata:ability/astra-militarum.voice-of-command) if they have it. This rule cannot bring in units with any of these keywords: **AIRCRAFT**, **OGRYN**, **EPIC HERO**, **RATLING**, **COMMISSAR**, **MINISTORUM PRIEST**, **MILITARUM TEMPESTUS** or **TECH-PRIEST ENGINSEER**.",
